                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Mohamed Ahsan Saleem is currently the Director of Operations at Treetop Hospital. He previously served as Head of Information Technology at Treetop Hospital. He has also held various positions in the field of tourism and hospitality. He has worked at Conrad Rangili, Hilton Seychelles, Les Roches Switzerland, and College du Liman Switzerland, as well as in the guest house and diving sectors in Sri Lanka. He has also worked for the Maldives Association of Tourism Industry and the Maldives Tourism Promotion Board.
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Mohamed Ahsan Saleem holds a Master of International Tourism and Hotel Management from Southern Cross University, Singapore. In addition, Mr. Mohamed Ahsan Saleem holds a Bachelor of Business in International Hotel and Resort Management from Blue Mountains International Hotel Management School, Australia. He also holds a Diploma in Hotel Management from Les Roches Hotel Management School in Switzerland. In addition, he holds a private pilot license from the Seletar Flying Club in Singapore. At the same time, he is an open water scuba diver instructor and emergency first response instructor at Kuredu Island Resort.
    </div>
</div>
                                                            </p>

